path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1254:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1259:                  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n1292:                      command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n1298:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1301:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1305:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1309:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1412:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1549:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1673:              GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1674:        