      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"The fixture derives from ADVISOR_DISABLED_FLAGS and asserts ten entries before the env assertion, so an empty or short constant fails loudly.\\\",\\n      \\\"ruledOutReason\\\": \\\"The size assertion runs first and the child env assertion is exact.\\\",\\n      \\\"targetRefs\\\": [\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts\\\"],\\n      \\\"searchActions\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"method\\\": \\\"direct_read\\\",\\n          \\\"queryOrPath\\\": \\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts:126-143\\\",\\n          \\\"result\\\": \\\"ten names derived from the constant; exact toEqual on the filtered child env\\\",\\n          \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts:129-143\\\"]\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-confirm-5b/iter-001.record.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1794781128644,"end":1794781156540}}}}
