CE.md:74-75` alone made the alias fix look complete; the canonical index its own header defers to still disagreed (iteration 1).\n - Treating the pass-five verifier's fix column as the full scope of the confirmed finding hid the second site the pass-five iteration had already named (iteration 1).\n - Counting the alias list as a finding in both iterations would have doubled one defect; the duplication had to be recorded as the cost on the one incomplete copy (iteration 2).\n - The per-iteration tool budget was exceeded while reading the trust boundary; the count is recorded rather than trimmed to look compliant (iteration 2).\n+- Iteration 1's provenance sentence said the five paths were unchanged \"after d21dbc1cafe\"; the exact check shows the fix landed at `d0f605b42f8` and nothing after it touched them, so the sentence was true but imprecise (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-confirm-5b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- The per-iteration tool budget was exceeded while reading the trust boundary; the count is recorded rather than trimmed to look compliant (iteration 2).\\n- Iteration 1's provenance sentence said the five paths were unchanged \\\"after d21dbc1cafe\\\"; the exact check shows the fix landed at `d0f605b42f8` and nothing after it touched them, so the sentence was true but imprecise (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- The per-iteration tool budget was exceeded while reading the trust boundary; the count is recorded rather than trimmed to look compliant (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-confirm-5b/dee